{"unit_id":"zhengjy01__dsh-settings-nav-organizer#card-zh","repo":"zhengjy01/dsh-settings-nav-organizer","commit":"b1c379bb7d968ba65ef4eb6420bf0f7efe3efe76","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-organizer 是面向 DSH Web 设置面板的导航整理插件。它读取设置区的入口并将第三方插件入口折叠到分组行，也提供可创建、重命名和删除的自定义书签式分组。用户可以在分组管理页开关折叠、搜索和整理入口、启用插件分类，并管理插件的启用状态或卸载插件；闲置插件清理支持扫描、预览和确认。分组与相关设置保存在浏览器 localStorage。自动分类可优先使用市场分类，也可配置 OpenAI 兼容模型；不配置模型仍可手动分组。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:958-969","lib/client.js:974-1007","lib/index.js:542-561","lib/index.js:837-846"]}
{"unit_id":"zhengjy01__dsh-settings-nav-organizer#card-en","repo":"zhengjy01/dsh-settings-nav-organizer","commit":"b1c379bb7d968ba65ef4eb6420bf0f7efe3efe76","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-settings-nav-organizer organizes the DSH Web settings sidebar. It folds plugin pages into collapsible groups and lets users create, rename, and delete custom groups. Users can search settings pages and manage plugins from its settings pages. Groups persist in browser localStorage.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:958-969","lib/client.js:974-1007","lib/index.js:542-561","lib/index.js:837-846"]}
